       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-PHOSPHOR-CANV.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PHOSPHOR-CANV-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TRAP-DECAY-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRACE-RESOLUTION-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEMPORAL-ALIGN-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHOSPHOR-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHOSPHOR-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-PHOSPHOR-CANV-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PPC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PPC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DECAY-AND-TRACE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ALIGN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PPC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DECAY-AND-TRACE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRAP-DECAY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRACE-RESOLUTION-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ALIGN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TEMPORAL-ALIGN-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHOSPHOR-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PPC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TRAP-DECAY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TRACE-RESOLUTION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TEMPORAL-ALIGN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PHOSPHOR-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PHOSPHOR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PPC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PPC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PPC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PPC-CODE.
